## SQ-DNR-O-01
@group old world
@commands Scratch server and client with the new CD jar plus both donor folders; load a copy of a 1.1.03+ world that has a placed paella plate (part eaten), a stuffed pufferfish, a sponge cake with bites, a sea grape column with fruit, wild sea grape and both crates; `grep -iE "oceanic_upstream\|Missing\|remap\|oceanic_delight" logs/latest.log`
@pass Boots; "Oceanic Delight upstream assets/data: N files" logged; no missing-id or remap lines; every block keeps its state and texture; creative tab "Oceanic Delight" lists the items
@fails Missing art: check `/datapack list` and the resource pack list for `oceanic_upstream_*`; a reset state: compare the property names in `ServingPlateBlock` / `SeaGrapePlantBlock`
@draft no batch holds this row yet
