@pass Bowls, bottle and shell come back; Comfort 5:00, Nourishment 5:00, Instant Breath (air full) apply, with blue tooltip lines; no bowl gives "You need a Bowl to eat this."; the empty paella pan is picked up (pan + skillet); a slice drops; bone meal adds a plant; the three Mining Fatigue potions brew and JEI shows them
@fails Compare with ocean_delight.md 5.6; missing effect: Farmer's Delight effect id lookup in `OceanicFood.farmers`
